Drop the self-update restart branch from run.sh.

With --disableupdate the returnCode == 2 path is dead code. Removing it makes
an unexpected update attempt fail loudly rather than spin in a restart loop
that looks like a healthy runner from the outside.

PLACEHOLDER: regenerate against the pinned tarball before M3.
    make upgrade-runner V=<pinned>   # extracts to build/upstream/tree
    cd build/upstream/tree && cp run.sh run.sh.orig && $EDITOR run.sh
    diff -u run.sh.orig run.sh > ../../../patches/0001-remove-selfupdate-loop.patch
